(7630521, 1236898, 67258, '<td valign="top">My grandfather thatched this in the 1950s!!!!!  He was quite an interesting and somewhat eccentric character - an atheist with a theology degree from Cambridge and a socialist intellectual. He enlisted under age as a stretcher bearer in the First World War, after which he became a life long pacifist and conscientious objector during WW2.  I''m not quite sure when he turned his hand to thatching - for most of my mother''s childhood at any rate.  He gave up when he fell off a ladder and broke his back.</td>', 'My grandfather thatched this in the 1950s!!!!!  He was quite an interesting and somewhat eccentric character - an atheist with a theology degree from Cambridge and a socialist intellectual. He enlisted under age as a stretcher bearer in the First World War, after which he became a life long pacifist and conscientious objector during WW2.  I''m not quite sure when he turned his hand to thatching - for most of my mother''s childhood at any rate.  He gave up when he fell off a ladder and broke his back.', '2019-05-24 13:30:11.000000', NULL, 1),
