(7631409, 1236898, 100831, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by SaraR:</b></div><hr/><i> My grandfather thatched this in the 1950s!!!!!  He was quite an interesting and somewhat eccentric character - an atheist with a theology degree from Cambridge and a socialist intellectual. He enlisted under age as a stretcher bearer in the First World War, after which he became a life long pacifist and conscientious objector during WW2.  I''m not quite sure when he turned his hand to thatching - for most of my mother''s childhood at any rate.  He gave up when he fell off a ladder and broke his back. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Thats SO COOL!!</td>', 'Originally posted by SaraR: My grandfather thatched this in the 1950s!!!!!  He was quite an interesting and somewhat eccentric character - an atheist with a theology degree from Cambridge and a socialist intellectual. He enlisted under age as a stretcher bearer in the First World War, after which he became a life long pacifist and conscientious objector during WW2.  I''m not quite sure when he turned his hand to thatching - for most of my mother''s childhood at any rate.  He gave up when he fell off a ladder and broke his back.   Thats SO COOL!!', '2019-05-31 01:13:06.000000', NULL, 0),
(7631414, 1236969, 135744, '<td valign="top">Congrats Robert on the HM. I haven''t been to this place but hear they do a nice bottle of wine. You have a great collection of photos from your trip to the UK.</td>', 'Congrats Robert on the HM. I haven''t been to this place but hear they do a nice bottle of wine. You have a great collection of photos from your trip to the UK.', '2019-05-31 06:27:02.000000', NULL, 0),
