(7631430, 1236719, 61396, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Pangurban:</b></div><hr/><i> It took me a moment.....where did they come from? Why?!? This gave me food for thought when scoring as I love the story it tells but not a great fan of the processing. Please can we see the original? </i></td></tr></table> <br/><a href="https://www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1237244" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/60000-64999/61396/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1237244.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/60000-64999/61396/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1237244.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/60000-64999/61396/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1237244.jpg"/></a> <br/>I had only the phone with snapseed, so cropped and used the "morning" filter.<br/> <br/><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by mariuca:</b></div><hr/><i>I don''t know where you were when you took the shot. Are you one of "them"?</i></td></tr></table> <br/>Took it from a balcony across the street.</td>', 'Originally posted by Pangurban: It took me a moment.....where did they come from? Why?!? This gave me food for thought when scoring as I love the story it tells but not a great fan of the processing. Please can we see the original?   I had only the phone with snapseed, so cropped and used the "morning" filter. Originally posted by mariuca:I don''t know where you were when you took the shot. Are you one of "them"? Took it from a balcony across the street.', '2019-05-31 11:28:50.000000', NULL, 0),
